        {
          "text": "Lino ndakabona Mwanambelele naakanamatula cimwi cinamatizyo, nkabela mpawo ndakamvwa umwi wabanyama bone ulaamba ajwi lili mbuli muzumo, wati, Boola, uzoobone, ",
