        {
          "text": "Lino naakanamatula cinamatizyo catatu, ndakamvwa munyama watatu wati, Boola, uzoobone. Mpawo ndakabona imbizi iisia, nkabela oyo iwakakede alinjiyo wakalijisi zyeelekelo mujanza lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.5",
