        {
          "text": "Mpawo ndakabona imbizi iisia-sia, nkabela oyo iwakatantide alinjiyo wali kutegwa ngu-Lufu, alakwe Gehena wamutobela. Elyo bakapegwa bwami bwakujaya cipanzi cane cabantu baansi, kuti bafwe amasumo, anzala, alufu, abanyama bamusokwe.",
